      "writtenOn": "2021-07-12T14:11:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not intended to be reset. Part of the reason for using a property was to persist the value for the duration of the boot of the VM so that, if keymint happened to restart for some reason, it would be able to recover without needing to reboot the whole VM. If that seems unnecessary, or there\u0027s a better way to do that then I\u0027ll change the approach.",
