      "writtenOn": "2021-07-12T14:26:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok. I actually don\u0027t understand why we should try to recover from such a failure, unless there\u0027s some non-determinism there. Anyway, I am fine with keeping this as it is, for the time being.",
      "parentUuid": "9d532522_2594d05c",
